    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>https://real-zony.github.io/en/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://real-zony.github.io/en/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m Zony, a .NET developer. I write C# for a living and like taking framework source code apart to see how it works.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Most of what&amp;rsquo;s here are notes on problems I ran into at work and on source code I read: written for the me of a few months from now who has forgotten the fix, and for you, if a search brought you here.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;stats&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;posts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;2015&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;since&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;small style=&#34;font-size:.6em&#34;&gt;k&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;words&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2&gt;Topics I write about&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;topics&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;https://real-zony.github.io/en/tags/abp/&#34;&gt;ABP&lt;span&gt;1 post&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;https://real-zony.github.io/en/tags/c%23/&#34;&gt;C#&lt;span&gt;1 post&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;https://real-zony.github.io/en/tags/castle-windsor/&#34;&gt;Castle Windsor&lt;span&gt;1 post&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;https://real-zony.github.io/en/tags/dependency-injection/&#34;&gt;Dependency Injection&lt;span&gt;1 post&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;https://real-zony.github.io/en/tags/dryioc/&#34;&gt;DryIoC&lt;span&gt;1 post&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;this-blog&#34;&gt;This blog&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;It&amp;rsquo;s built with &lt;a href=&#34;https://gohugo.io&#34;&gt;Hugo&lt;/a&gt; and hosted on GitHub Pages. Comments use giscus, which needs a GitHub account.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A cat lies on the line under the header. While you read a post it walks along the orange progress line, and when you finish it asks whether you&amp;rsquo;d like to leave a comment; after 40 seconds without scrolling it falls asleep. Click it to pet it, or click it further down a post and it takes you back to the top.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;contact&#34;&gt;Contact&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;GitHub: &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/real-zony&#34;&gt;real-zony&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;reposting&#34;&gt;Reposting&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Posts are licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 by default. Please credit the source when reposting, and don&amp;rsquo;t use them commercially.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</description>
